{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"29abcd9b2486e9f5","type":"group","x":960,"y":-720,"width":5720,"height":3040,"color":"5","label":"数据分析流程"},
		{"id":"17bbd722221ba30d","type":"group","x":1640,"y":2320,"width":4440,"height":520,"color":"2","label":"待解决的问题"},
		{"id":"9361776d0ccdc902","type":"text","text":"问题\n\n物理颜色和记忆颜色如何在 SEEG 中表征？\n\n状态：当前项目科学问题","x":-440,"y":-420,"width":420,"height":220},
		{"id":"41c2570ee3d6b3eb","type":"text","text":"**核磁记录**\n\n[/ieeg](E:\\liulab_project\\ColorLocalizer_Exp_results)\n","x":-740,"y":-120,"width":275,"height":90},
		{"id":"cb9bdcce7df9817d","type":"text","text":"**原始的seeg信号记录数据**\n\n/rawdata（.bdf）\n","x":13,"y":-165,"width":275,"height":90},
		{"id":"d0b47e3eada495b8","type":"text","text":"**/seegdata**（.mat）\n","x":86,"y":180,"width":130,"height":60},
		{"id":"d87d064565ca2f21","type":"text","text":"**实验同步的marker记录**\n包括了pic和trigger\n[/rawdata](E:\\liulab_project\\Project_colorieeg_2026\\visual_experiment)（.mat）\n","x":787,"y":-380,"width":255,"height":95},
		{"id":"18ce6b6e90d3b7ca","type":"text","text":"**C02**\n**预处理步骤**\n1. 读取seeg信号和event。\n2. 减去该通道全长信号的中位数，以去除稳健 DC/ADC 偏置。\n3. 从 1000 Hz 重采样至 500 Hz。\n4. 零相位时域滤波: 1–30 Hz 四阶 Butterworth 带通 (纯净 ERP 信号) + 50 Hz 陷波 (Q=30)\n5. 依次进行 50、100、150 Hz 零相位陷波，Q=30。\n6. 去除人工标记的坏道。\n7. 局部 Laplacian 重参考。\n8. 时间窗 -500–1000 ms 的 epoch；","x":1068,"y":-75,"width":439,"height":285},
		{"id":"574e58102229664e","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/multisite_decoding/multisite_decoding_task2_timecourses_6bands.png","x":3682,"y":-640,"width":714,"height":460},
		{"id":"5917ff26b637f0e7","type":"text","text":"**process_data**","x":1201,"y":-230,"width":174,"height":50},
		{"id":"51621e62f2e3ef30","type":"text","text":"**plot_channel_timecourse.m**","x":2397,"y":782,"width":280,"height":50},
		{"id":"085c213d8049edff","type":"text","text":"color_analyse_0825/result/tables/color_effects_summary.csv","x":1737,"y":807,"width":250,"height":95},
		{"id":"edb2e0c8e2d7d267","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/decoding/sub001_G13_memory_color_decoding.png","x":2747,"y":1647,"width":800,"height":320},
		{"id":"eafd47aae9fd6c27","type":"text","text":"**p<0.05每种频段有大概35个位点，但是难以看出不同频段的分布以及正负号的分布**\n**调参1：**\np<0.005每种频段下大概只有三个位点\n**调参2：**\n进行fdr矫正也几乎没有\n**调参3：**\n只选择同向的电极","x":2946,"y":1077,"width":400,"height":231},
		{"id":"83f96c3fada4f6c3","type":"text","text":"使用fdr得到的显著的两个颜色选择性电极进行记忆颜色decoding\n结论：效果一般","x":2952,"y":1407,"width":389,"height":96},
		{"id":"790d8dbee1d4e33e","type":"text","text":"**C06 task2数据的处理**","x":3037,"y":573,"width":217,"height":55},
		{"id":"63cf1e33221d681d","type":"text","text":"**这一步中的思考**\n如果使用多电极，就是在整个通路上同时存在这记忆颜色和感知颜色的信息\n\n如果是单电极的decoding，就以为这记忆颜色和感知颜色是同样的神经表征\n\n对于真假颜色的水果，就可以分辨其本身的记忆颜色和感知颜色的并行传输，以及对于真假概念的汇总。","x":3810,"y":210,"width":456,"height":266},
		{"id":"02bc29b7af3e781b","type":"text","text":"**C08 task3的数据处理**","x":4744,"y":568,"width":213,"height":60},
		{"id":"23b0e329bb5b3b3a","type":"text","text":"**C09 task3中纯色色块的decoding**","x":5271,"y":570,"width":306,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bdbd39831f844a5a","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/glass_brain/uncorrected_p0.05_concordant/matlab_glass_brain_Alpha_3view.png","x":2338,"y":1293,"width":399,"height":160},
		{"id":"ca87727d17a211de","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/spatiotemporal/cluster_spatiotemporal_distribution_task3_XYZ.png","x":5720,"y":1031,"width":772,"height":324,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c051a36e9f3edef4","type":"text","text":"**C01**\n**MARKER对齐矫正与trial的pic_label**\n\n1.刺激电脑记录的marker是否与seeg记录到的trigger是对齐的。\n2.从打trigger的代码上验证marker时间是否是图片呈现时间。\n3.检验正确之后将pic_label放入","x":420,"y":90,"width":450,"height":240},
		{"id":"6b3d8278d153b589","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/颜色选择电极汇总.png","x":1662,"y":927,"width":400,"height":271},
		{"id":"77413ab550139753","type":"text","text":"**C07 task2中记忆颜色的交叉decoding**","x":3870,"y":571,"width":335,"height":58,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2bf4abdff4d5ef62","type":"text","text":"**单电极的decoding（单频段或者多频段）**","x":4665,"y":343,"width":292,"height":82,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1fdf0fec2ef37945","type":"text","text":"**C03**\n**相同预处理+对连续数据的频率特征提取**\n1. 提取六个经典的频段：\n\t1. Delta(1-4hz),\n\t2. Theta(4-8hz),\n\t3. Alpha(8-12hz),\n\t4. Beta(13-30hz),\n\t5. Low gamma(30-60hz, 避开50hz)\n\t6. High gamma(70-140hz，避开100hz的5个子频段等全平均)\n2. 切分epoch（[-500,1000]ms,[-300,-100]ms基线矫正）","x":1057,"y":397,"width":450,"height":400},
		{"id":"6be0c1eb57a5f4b3","type":"text","text":"**C04 颜色选择性电极筛选**\n**总体显著+类别同向**\n1. 对每种频段都进行独立比较\n2. 类别内同图配对\n3. 使用[100,400]ms进行等权色彩效应\n4. 总体p值是怎么得到的？\n5. 方向一致性判断，有三种，同正，同负，不同\n","x":1955,"y":476,"width":454,"height":250},
		{"id":"625f5dd325cd6a6b","type":"text","text":"**C11 task2记忆颜色的单频段多位点decoding**","x":5232,"y":45,"width":385,"height":50},
		{"id":"7cc4d7d788ff1041","type":"text","text":"**C10 task3纯色块的单频段多位点decoding**","x":3846,"y":45,"width":385,"height":50},
		{"id":"b5f1865a5a566d9b","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/timecourses/sub002/High_Gamma/test002_D4_High_Gamma_timecourse.png","x":2347,"y":907,"width":400,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"45a30c06104e3569","type":"text","text":"**plot_glass_brain_3view_0825.m**","x":2397,"y":1165,"width":300,"height":50},
		{"id":"697d24ecf36b54b9","type":"text","text":"color patch所在的电极有什么样的反应","x":1840,"y":2660,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"23cff0c1c44d5878","type":"text","text":"这些位点真的是颜色相关吗？","x":2039,"y":2400,"width":286,"height":60},
		{"id":"22beb132c98b76e0","type":"text","text":"在整个颜色加工环路中，前人还定位出了哪些roi位点","x":2280,"y":2660,"width":422,"height":60},
		{"id":"a1d734ef60fe3f10","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/spatiotemporal/cluster_spatiotemporal_distribution_all_significant_XYZ.png","x":4079,"y":1165,"width":772,"height":324,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"1ff3347bdcae42d6","type":"file","file":"color_analyse_0825/result/figures/spatiotemporal/cluster_spatiotemporal_distribution_XYZ.png","x":4079,"y":1880,"width":782,"height":328},
		{"id":"61929ec8bd73367a","type":"text","text":"color的decoding和刺激产生光幻视之间的关联","x":5299,"y":2380,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"48d711e238ba2713","type":"text","text":"多频段的decoding能说明什么？单频段的decoding能说明什么？","x":3778,"y":2374,"width":520,"height":60},
		{"id":"be652a9d0334eda8","x":2507,"y":2542,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"同向和反向要不要探讨"}
